1
00:00:07,173 --> 00:00:09,009
Who is this at this hour?

2
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:14,175
You called me out, so why
aren't you saying anything?

3
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:15,682
It's cold.

4
00:00:16,056 --> 00:00:17,056
I'm getting inside.

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,560
Jeongho.

6
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:23,939
Huh?

7
00:00:24,107 --> 00:00:25,107
Sorry.

8
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,233
What are you sorry about?

9
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:28,546
I don't think I can
keep my promise.

10
00:00:35,326 --> 00:00:37,120
You can't even
keep your promise.

11
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:39,164
I thought I could
hide it well.

12
00:00:39,831 --> 00:00:41,416
I felt like I could hide it.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,501
I'm alright now, I swear.

14
00:00:44,419 --> 00:00:45,795
I can treat you normally.

15
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:47,629
I'm...

16
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:51,633
I envy you.

17
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:52,760
For being like that.

18
00:00:55,138 --> 00:00:56,138
I think

19
00:00:57,223 --> 00:00:58,933
I will always feel this way.

20
00:01:00,185 --> 00:01:01,185
Okay.

21
00:01:08,443 --> 00:01:09,527
I'm getting inside first.

22
00:01:10,445 --> 00:01:11,805
I'll see you
on the field tomorrow.

23
00:01:12,155 --> 00:01:13,155
Like any other day

24
00:01:14,115 --> 00:01:15,115
as if nothing happened.

25
00:01:17,952 --> 00:01:18,952
Yeah.

26
00:01:19,537 --> 00:01:20,914
Like nothing happened.
